# Coverage gate that MIRRORS CI: excludes the env-gated integration tests
# (tmux-live needs a real tmux, composer-pty needs a pty) so the number matches
# what CI measures on a bare runner — and so a missing tmux/pty can't flake the
# push. Catches a coverage regression locally before it reaches CI.
npm run test:coverage
npm audit --audit-level=high
# Type-aware lint (mirrors CI's lint:deep). Surfaces the no-unnecessary-condition
# WARNINGS locally before the push instead of only in the CI log; the async-hygiene
# rules (floating / misused promises) ERROR here, so a real bug blocks the push.
npm run lint:deep
